Package: ti-tidl
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 libc6,
 libgcc-s1,
 libstdc++6,
 libtivision-apps11.2.0,
 libti-rpmsg-char0
Description: TI TIDL Delegate Libraries (arm-tidl)
 Source-built TIDL inference delegate shared libraries for TI EdgeAI
 platforms. Built from the arm-tidl repository matching the ti-tidl Yocto
 recipe in meta-edgeai.
 .
 Provides:
  libvx_tidl_rt.so.1.0       — TIDL OpenVX runtime
  libtidl_tfl_delegate.so.1.0 — TFLite delegate
  libtidl_onnxrt_EP.so.1.0   — ONNX Runtime execution provider
  libtidlrt_EP.so.1.0         — TIDL RT execution provider
 .
 Also installs a test binary at /opt/tidl_test/.
 .
 Compatible with: j721e, j721s2, j784s4, j742s2, j722s, am62axx.

Package: ti-tidl-dev
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ti-tidl (= ${binary:Version})
Description: TI TIDL Delegate Libraries - development headers
 C++ headers for building against the arm-tidl TIDL delegate libraries.
 .
 Headers: itidl_rt.h, itidl_io.h, itvm_rt.h.
